Package: BioinfoTools
Title: General-Purpose Tools for Bulk RNA-Seq Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcelo", "Hurtado", email = "marcelo.hurt137@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of general-purpose functions for bulk RNA-seq analysis:
    transcription factor and pathway activity inference from expression or from a
    differential expression signature (scored via 'decoupleR' against CollecTRI,
    Dorothea, ARACNE, PROGENy, KEGG, REACTOME, or MSigDB Hallmark), differential
    expression analysis with 'edgeR'/'limma-voom' and volcano plots, gene set
    enrichment (ORA/GSEA) against GO/KEGG/REACTOME/PROGENy/Hallmark, Kaplan-Meier
    survival analysis, TPM/z-score normalization, 'ComBat-seq' batch correction,
    principal component analysis, and parametric/non-parametric association testing
    between a score matrix and a continuous or categorical trait.
